<title>POLAND: NOVITA OCT NET RISES TO PLN 1.3 MLN.</title>
<headline>NOVITA OCT NET RISES TO PLN 1.3 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results October</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>OCTOBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     1.29 vs   0.60</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 1.97 vs   0.67</p>
<p> Operating profit     2.22 vs   0.99</p>
<p> Sales		    8.21 vs   6.43</p>
<p>JANUARY-OCTOBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     3.46 vs   3.21</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 5.21 vs   3.61</p>
<p> Operating profit     7.34 vs   4.07</p>
<p> Sales		   55.42 vs  44.80</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish carpet maker is Novita SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
